DATA AND PRIVACY
----------------

The Software is designed to hold personal data about identified children, their
guardians, and staff, together with financial records. Whoever deploys it is the
data controller and is solely responsible for:

  - lawfulness, purpose limitation and retention of the data it holds;
  - the confidentiality of `backend/db.sqlite3` (or the production database),
    `backend/media/`, `.env`, and every `db.sqlite3.bak-*` snapshot;
  - changing or deleting the seeded demo accounts and their documented
    passwords (`AdminPass123!`, `TeacherPass1!`, `StudentPass1!`, `ParentPass1!`,
    `DirPass123!`, `FinPass123!`) before any real or public deployment;
  - backups, restore drills and breach notification.

Teklora Solutions accepts no liability for data loss, disclosure or regulatory
consequences arising from a deployment.


